# Only what belongs to the project is kept: everything at the top level is ignored unless it
# is listed here, so runs, logs, build directories and binaries need no rule of their own.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/build.rs
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/LICENSE
!/apps/
!/cuda_bridge/
!/docs/
!/examples/
!/src/
!/tests/
# Inside those: the output of runs started there (`output.file` in a parameter file), logs,
# editor files.
*.out
*.log
*.swp
__pycache__/
